 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "hook1",
   "text": "Sunday morning on the motorway. Then, right across all three lanes: a wall of fog.",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "id": "hook2",
   "text": "Hooves. Trumpets. And out of the fog ride knights. What do you do?",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong1",
   "text": "Most drivers think: honk! Flash the lights! Rev the engine! They'll get out of the way.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong2",
   "text": "But a red beast with glowing eyes, that roars? To a knight, that's a dragon.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong3",
   "text": "Twenty knights charge. You flee into the fog. They follow. And out you come, in the year thirteen forty-seven. In a cage. The first dragon they've ever caught.",
   "gap": 0.9
  },
  {
   "id": "wrong4",
   "text": "Exam failed.",
   "gap": 1.15
  },
  {
   "id": "right1",
   "text": "Here's how you do it properly.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "right2",
   "text": "Stop. Engine off. Window down.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right3",
   "text": "Knights love good manners. So bow. Even your car bows.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right4",
   "text": "The king rides up. He draws his sword. And taps your roof. Once. Twice.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "right5",
   "text": "Arise, Sir Car-a-lot!",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "right6",
   "text": "They give you a royal flag for your aerial. Then they ride back into the fog. And the fog rolls away.",
   "gap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "right7",
   "text": "Exam passed.",
   "gap": 1.3
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "text": "Next exam question: hailstones, the size of footballs. Follow, so you don't miss it.",
   "gap": 1.2
  }
 ],
